  "bio": "Evelyn is a highly skilled tattoo artist, specializing in intricate floral, geometric, and fineline designs that adorn the skin like delicate pieces of art. Her work is a testament to her exceptional talent, commanding proficiency in blackwork that brings each piece to life with precision and grace. Those looking to immortalize nature’s beauty on their skin or seeking statement geometric patterns will find her designs to be nothing short of exquisite.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n🖤Tattooist/blackwork- DM for enquiries. @evelynsgarden_uk wild glamping/camping enquiries. 🖤🏕✨",
